<title>PHILIPPINES: Metrobank 9-mth net close to 3.2 bln pesos.</title>
<headline>Metrobank 9-mth net close to 3.2 bln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1996-10-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metropolitan Bank and Trust Co MBT.PS is expected to report on Wednesday a net profit &quot;close to 3.2 billion pesos,&quot; a senior bank official said on Monday.</p>
<p>The bank posted a net income of 2.287 billion pesos in the same period last year.</p>
</text>
